Maintainer: Richard Detomasi <richard.detomasi@gmail.com>
Description: Loads official geographic information of Uruguay, such as
    administrative boundaries, census areas, streets and public services,
    from the services of public agencies like the 'IDE', the 'INE' and the
    'MIDES', as 'sf' objects, and provides functions to process them. It also
    turns addresses into coordinates and back, and downloads the orthophotos
    of an area, through the services of the Uruguayan 'IDE'
    <https://www.gub.uy/infraestructura-datos-espaciales/tramites-y-servicios/servicios/servicio-direcciones-geograficas>.
